### =====================================================================
### 6. RESERVATION (dépend du véhicule et du client)
### =====================================================================

### GET all - Reservations (200)
GET {{reservationsUrl}}

### GET by id - Reservation (200)
GET {{reservationsUrl}}/1

### POST valide - Reservation (201)
POST {{reservationsUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dateDebut": "2030-01-10",
  "dateFin": "2030-01-15",
  "statut": "EN_ATTENTE",
  "vehiculeId": 1,
  "clientId": 1
}

### POST invalide - Reservation dateFin avant dateDebut (400)
POST {{reservationsUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dateDebut": "2030-01-15",
  "dateFin": "2030-01-10",
  "statut": "EN_ATTENTE",
  "vehiculeId": 1,
  "clientId": 1
}

### PUT - Reservation (200)
PUT {{reservationsUrl}}/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dateDebut": "2030-01-10",
  "dateFin": "2030-01-20",
  "statut": "CONFIRMEE",
  "vehiculeId": 1,
  "clientId": 1
}

### DELETE - Reservation (204)
DELETE {{reservationsUrl}}/1

### GET id inexistant - Reservation (404)
GET {{reservationsUrl}}/99999


