Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dateSignature": "2030-01-10",
  "valide": true,
  "reservationId": 1
}

### PUT - Contrat (200)
PUT {{contratsUrl}}/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dateSignature": "2030-01-11",
  "montantTotal": 550.00,
  "valide": true,
  "reservationId": 1
}

### DELETE - Contrat (204)
DELETE {{contratsUrl}}/1

### GET id inexistant - Contrat (404)
GET {{contratsUrl}}/99999


