### =====================================================================
### 9. MAINTENANCE (dépend du véhicule)
### =====================================================================

### GET all - Maintenances (200)
GET {{maintenancesUrl}}

### GET by id - Maintenance (200)
GET {{maintenancesUrl}}/1

### POST valide - Maintenance (201)
POST {{maintenancesUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dateDebut": "2029-12-01",
  "dateFin": "2029-12-05",
  "description": "Vidange et révision",
  "cout": 120.00,
  "vehiculeId": 1
}

### POST invalide - Maintenance dateFin avant dateDebut (400)
POST {{maintenancesUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dateDebut": "2029-12-05",
  "dateFin": "2029-12-01",
  "description": "",
  "cout": -50,
  "vehiculeId": 1
}

### PUT - Maintenance (200)
PUT {{maintenancesUrl}}/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dateDebut": "2029-12-01",
  "dateFin": "2029-12-07",
  "description": "Vidange, révision et freins",
  "cout": 180.00,
  "vehiculeId": 1
}

### DELETE - Maintenance (204)
DELETE {{maintenancesUrl}}/1

### GET id inexistant - Maintenance (404)
GET {{maintenancesUrl}}/99999
